    "Total 60 as published (headers 1/10/15/7/3/13/11).",
    "The strategy says 'you start most of the time with Oppresive Enforcement', so Oppressive Enforcement (the Special Edition Effect; no Defensive Shields in April 2000) is the starting Effect. Endor, Endor: Bunker and Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) are the Objective's starting sites.",
    "Posted ''   ' Bunker' and ''   ' Landing Platform' (ditto marks under Endor) dested Endor: Bunker and Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay); 'Corlug' Corulag; 'Kashyk' Kashyyyk; 'Commander Nemit' Commander Nemet; 'DS612/613/614' DS-61-2/3/4; 'Boba Fett/Bossk/Zuckuss n/ Ship' the pilot-in-ship cards; 'Executer' Executor; 'Vader's Shuttle' Vader's Personal Shuttle; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser.",
    "Posted 'There Be He To Pay x2' dested There'll Be Hell To Pay; 'Resistence' the Jabba's Palace Effect Resistance; 'Masterful Movc' Masterful Move. Battle Order is the Endor Effect.",
